<li>Metode Hartree–Fock (Self-Consistent Field method)</li>
<li>Teori fungsi rapatan (Density Functional Theory)</li>
<li>Teori fungsi rapatan tak-gayut waktu]] (Time-dependent Density Functional Theory)</li>
<li>Pasca-Hartree–Fock</li>
<li>QM/MM</li>
